message: "If you use WARDEN in research or a report, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "WARDEN — MCP security firewall"
abstract: "Vets an MCP server's advertised tool definitions against static-scan rules, a signed threat feed, origin and tool-definition pinning before any tool reaches the model. Zero-dependency TypeScript library, CLI scan, stdio wrap proxy and Claude Code hook."
authors:
