    title: "HISTOR snapshot: MCP tool definitions and how they change"
    doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23512759
    authors:
      - family-names: Artamokhov
        given-names: Aleksandr
    notes: "The public transparency log whose observations WARDEN's threat feed and field measurements draw on."
